    "name": "Again!? The Sheriff\u2019s Kinky Justice",
    "steam_appid": 3834840,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A new case awaits the sheriff, packed with mystery, red herrings, and\u2026 girls?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834840/extras/fb72d3686df48ec770c3a042ae1e0deb.avif?t=1755426797\" width=616 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A visual novel, point-and-click detective game with complete freedom of choice. A scorching Western atmosphere. Clues, booze, and attractive girls!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over 110 images of girls in various poses and situations</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>7 women to interrogate, each vying for the Sheriff\u2019s attention</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete freedom of action. Explore locations, find clues, and try to unravel this tangled web through interrogation! But remember, time is limited, keep an eye on the timer before the trial begins</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple endings. Accuse whoever you believe is guilty, just be sure to provide the necessary evidence</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don\u2019t forget to have fun, you can always play with one hand</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834840/extras/26d342f5bf66d1edae479cb9447aaf84.avif?t=1755426797\" width=616 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gruesome murder has occurred in the mansion, leaving only two witnesses. The killer is skilled at concealing their appearance, leaving the Sheriff with virtually no useful information. He\u2019ll have to solve this mystery on his own, using his wits and the clues scattered throughout the location.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, fate will lead the Sheriff to various places, each adding more arguments to the case. Furthermore, everyone has their own opinion about what happened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Sheriff doesn\u2019t care about any of it. He\u2019s not interested in this investigation. But a little bonus, in the form of a large sum of money, compels him to take action. Of course, the girls will never leave him in peace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834840/extras/ddbda33cdf3ed46538feabe47e01fe16.avif?t=1755426797\" width=360 height=320 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <strong>Ashley</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ashley just happened to be in the wrong place at the wrong time. While she and the Sheriff know each other, they rarely spend time together. The Sheriff finds Ashley too boring and timid, although she\u2019s had a few brushes with the law. Now, Ashley has to wait for the Sheriff\u2019s decision; her future is entirely in his hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834840/extras/12df7db177aa93f3959c607b4477c532.avif?t=1755426797\" width=360 height=320 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <strong>Trish</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A long-time acquaintance of the Sheriff. She\u2019s always somewhere nearby. She constantly interferes with the Sheriff\u2019s work, but the collaboration is mutual. Now, they\u2019re destined to spend time together again, though the Sheriff will have to keep a closer eye on her than usual.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834840/extras/92c94106c6565e1b7e6587dc6d0c8bca.avif?t=1755426797\" width=360 height=320 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <strong>Hannah</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fiercely independent woman. The Sheriff and she were strangers until now, but they\u2019re about to become very well acquainted. Hannah is the antithesis of patient and compliant. He\u2019ll need to tame her wild spirit before he can bring her under his control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834840/extras/9509b168f6579199f8cca1d386e286e5.avif?t=1755426797\" width=616 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>These lovely ladies, and others, are ready and waiting in the game! What\u2019s stopping you?</strong></p>",
