s with the Sheriff\u2019s work, but the collaboration is mutual. Now, they\u2019re destined to spend time together again, though the Sheriff will have to keep a closer eye on her than usual.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834840/extras/92c94106c6565e1b7e6587dc6d0c8bca.avif?t=1755426797\" width=360 height=320 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <strong>Hannah</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fiercely independent woman. The Sheriff and she were strangers until now, but they\u2019re about to become very well acquainted. Hannah is the antithesis of patient and compliant. He\u2019ll need to tame her wild spirit before he can bring her under his control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834840/extras/9509b168f6579199f8cca1d386e286e5.avif?t=1755426797\" width=616 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>These lovely ladies, and others, are ready and waiting in the game! What\u2019s stopping you?</strong></p>",
